details.returned_prompt:
{
  "high_level_description": "An editorial outdoor photograph of a young woman pitching a solo backpacking tent on a damp lawn in the green fells of northern England, with misty hills and a slate-grey lake receding behind her, shot on a 35mm lens with fine Kodak Portra grain.",
  "compositional_deconstruction": {
    "background": "A damp late-morning garden in the green fells of northern England under overcast diffused daylight from a soft north-facing sky, neutral cool-toned white balance with accurate greens. Rolling green fells rise in the distance softened by low mist and mild atmospheric haze separating the midground from the far hills, with a thin slate-grey lake visible between two hills. A distant stone wall runs along the far meadow line. Light drizzle falls as fine streaks across the deeper background. The ground is a flat patch of rain-darkened lawn, grass wet and slightly matted. Fine Kodak Portra grain across the frame.",
    "elements": [
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Distant stone wall running along the far meadow line in the background, low and weathered grey limestone, partially hazed by atmospheric mist."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Single sheep grazing beside the distant stone wall in the far background, small in scale, cream-white wool, head lowered to the grass, facing left toward the wall."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Modern one-person backpacking tent at full standing height, anchored centre-right on a flat patch of rain-darkened lawn. Outer fly up and taut in muted olive-green, inner tent clipped inside, poles forming a clean dome silhouette. Guy-lines slack but ready, anchored at the corners. Small water beads visible on the fly fabric from light drizzle."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Wet peat-stained brown leather hiking boots left upside-down near the tent door in the midground, mud-darkened soles facing up, inner mesh flap of the tent pushed aside behind them."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Young woman kneeling beside the windward end of the tent in three-quarter front view facing right toward the tent corner, body filling roughly 40% of the frame height as the focal subject. Weight settled onto her right knee, left foot planted flat on the turf. Both hands working a stainless steel peg into the ground at the front corner of the tent. Head tilted down toward her hands with a small focused half-smile, gaze directed at the peg. Light skin tone, hair pulled back under a charcoal beanie. Faded olive shell jacket zipped halfway, dark grey hiking trousers rolled once at the ankle, scuffed brown leather hiking boots. Her skin has a natural, detailed texture."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Open canvas stuff sack tipped on its side in the foreground grass just in front of the tent, natural beige canvas, holding a coil of multicolour paracord and a second stainless steel peg spilling out onto the wet turf."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Small enamel mug of tea resting on a folded wool blanket just behind the tent's rear pole in the midground-right. Cream enamel mug with a dark rim, faint steam curling upward from the surface. Blanket folded in deep charcoal wool beneath it."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Out-of-focus holly bush slicing into the lower-left foreground edge, glossy dark green leaves with sharp spines, water droplets clinging to the leaf surfaces catching the soft overcast light, softly blurred by shallow depth of field."
      }
    ]
  }
}
